> ### Name: Dqdif
> ### Title: Compare Dependent Groups via Quantile Differences (Single
> ###   Quantile Pair)
> ### Aliases: Dqdif
> ### Keywords: htest robust
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> # Test paired data for symmetry
> set.seed(123)
> x <- rnorm(30, mean = 0)
> y <- rnorm(30, mean = 0.5)
> result <- Dqdif(x, y, plotit = FALSE)
> result$p.value  # Test for asymmetry
[1] 0.004
