> ### Name: DqdifMC
> ### Title: Compare Dependent Groups Using Quantiles (Parallel Processing)
> ### Aliases: DqdifMC
> ### Keywords: htest robust
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> # Compare two dependent groups at quartiles
> set.seed(123)
> x <- rnorm(30)
> y <- x + rnorm(30, 0.5, 1)  # Slight shift
> DqdifMC(x, y, q = 0.25, nboot = 500, plotit = FALSE)
